    <div>
      <p begin="00:00:00.150" end="00:00:07.380" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:00:00.150" end="00:00:07.380">96 degrees in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:00:07.380" end="00:00:14.740" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:00:07.380" end="00:00:14.740">Real hot in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:00:14.740" end="00:00:21.920" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:00:14.740" end="00:00:21.920">96 degrees in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:00:21.920" end="00:00:29.940" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:00:21.920" end="00:00:29.940">Real hot (whoa-yes) in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:00:34.020" end="00:00:41.980" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:00:34.020" end="00:00:41.980">Said it was 96 degrees in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:00:41.980" end="00:00:49.470" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:00:41.980" end="00:00:49.470">Ten thousand soldiers on parade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:00:49.470" end="00:00:56.740" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:00:49.470" end="00:00:56.740">Taking I and I to meet a big fat boy</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:00:56.740" end="00:01:00.260" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:00:56.740" end="00:01:00.260">Sent from overseas</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:00.260" end="00:01:04.050" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:00.260" end="00:01:04.050">The queen employ</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:04.050" end="00:01:07.250" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:04.050" end="00:01:07.250">Excellency before you, I come</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:07.250" end="00:01:10.100" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:07.250" end="00:01:10.100">With my representation</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:10.100" end="00:01:13.050" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:10.100" end="00:01:13.050">You know where I&apos;m coming from</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:18.260" end="00:01:20.020" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:18.260" end="00:01:20.020">You caught me on the loose</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:20.020" end="00:01:21.670" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:20.020" end="00:01:21.670">Fighting to be free</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:21.670" end="00:01:23.930" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:21.670" end="00:01:23.930">Now you show me a noose</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:23.930" end="00:01:25.280" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:23.930" end="00:01:25.280">On the cotton tree</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:25.280" end="00:01:29.210" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:25.280" end="00:01:29.210">Entertainment for you</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:29.210" end="00:01:33.040" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:29.210" end="00:01:33.040">Martyrdom for me</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:33.040" end="00:01:40.220" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:33.040" end="00:01:40.220">96 degrees in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:40.220" end="00:01:47.610" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:40.220" end="00:01:47.610">Real hot in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:47.610" end="00:01:54.660" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:47.610" end="00:01:54.660">96 degrees in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:01:54.660" end="00:02:02.610" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:01:54.660" end="00:02:02.610">Real hot (whoa-yes) in the shade</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:02:32.470" end="00:02:39.650" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:02:32.470" end="00:02:39.650">Some may suffer, and some may burn</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:02:39.650" end="00:02:46.810" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:02:39.650" end="00:02:46.810">But I know that one day, my people will learn</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:02:46.810" end="00:02:53.270" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:02:46.810" end="00:02:53.270">As sure as the sun shines way up in the sky</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="00:02:53.270" end="00:03:00.720" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:02:53.270" end="00:03:00.720">Today I stand here a victim, the truth is I&apos;ll never die</span>
      </p>
